---
description: Visual rules for the shop and the desk
globs: "**/*.{tsx,css}"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow DESIGN.md. Use the CSS tokens. Do not add a colour, radius, or shadow without a token.

Body text stays at least 18px. Tap targets stay at least 48px. Prices use tabular numbers.

Support reduced motion. Do not animate from scale zero. Animate only transform and opacity, under 300ms.

One accent, used for the main action. Photographs use a 4:5 crop unless the desk sets a focal point.
